opentune-cbf
============

This crate parses Mercedes-Benz CBF (CAESAR diagnostic description) files.

The binary layout handling (stub/CFF/CTF headers, the CTF string pool, the
bit-flag primitive reader, the ECU block layout and the DTC / service / variant
record formats) is adapted from the **CBFParser** component of the
OpenVehicleDiag project:

    OpenVehicleDiag — https://github.com/rnd-ash/OpenVehicleDiag
    Copyright (C) Ashcon Mohseninia and the OpenVehicleDiag contributors
    Licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0

OpenVehicleDiag is licensed GPL-3.0, which is compatible with OpenTune
(GPL-3.0-or-later). The CBF format handling has been re-implemented here as a
clean, dependency-light library with its own public API and model types; the
binary field order and offset arithmetic follow the original CBFParser so that
real-world Mercedes `.cbf` files decode identically.

NOT INCLUDED / DELIBERATELY OMITTED
-----------------------------------
OpenVehicleDiag's SMR-D parser was removed from upstream under a DMCA takedown.
No SMR-D parsing is reimplemented, ported or included in this crate. This crate
handles the CBF format only.

